  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Works! 2024 visit on solar and horticulture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Africa Works! 2024 provides an unique opportunity to showcase Africa&apos;s potential by presenting its highly attractive environment for business and investment opportunities.In the context of the Africa Works! 2024 conference, Nigerian companies can forge valuable business contacts, specifically in the solar and horticulture sector. Moreover, visits to Dutch companies and participation in thematic workshops facilitates two-way knowledge transfer and increases market understanding.This project&apos;s overarching goal is to develop and improve the (increasing) existing economic ties between the Netherlands and Nigeria, particularly in the solar industry and horticulture sector.The purpose of this incoming visit is to connect Nigerian companies with the Dutch private sector by providing networking opportunities, access to finance, market understanding, and enabling skill development and market expansion.</narrative>
  </description>
